<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES JUMP 8.9 PCT IN JANUARY.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES JUMP 8.9 PCT IN JANUARY.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian</p>
<p>industry soared by 8.9 percent in January from last December,</p>
<p>when they saw a 2.4 percent rise, National Statistics Board</p>
<p>(CNS) data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>January's producer prices were 70.4 percent up year-on-year</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	 JAN 97    DEC 96   JAN 96</p>
<p> mth/mth change			+8.9     +2.4	+2.6</p>
<p>  extraction industry		+1.4     +0.2	+0.4</p>
<p>  processing industry	     +10.5     +2.9	+2.9</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	  +1.1     +0.2	+1.4</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
